  "description": "Despite being an Alpha and an Omega, Doha and Jio have survived years of friendship as bickering, hot-headed childhood friends. But all it takes is one night to ruin the status quo. When Doha goes into a sudden, unexpected rut, Jio unfortunately drops by his house at the worst possible time. While Doha needs to process the fact that he's somehow shared a night with his best friend and long-time crush, he starts seeing signs...such as Jio throwing up out of the blue, and visiting an OB/GYN on his own. Why is Jio keeping him in the dark about what's happening?! If he's pregnant, Doha is ready to step up. So, for the love of god...baby, we need to talk!\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)\n\n*Note: Includes three extra chapters.*",
